Sync None
Create Near
Expunge Near
CopyArrivalDate yes

MaildirStore home
Path ~/Mail/
Inbox ~/Mail/INBOX
Trash ~/Mail/Trash
SubFolders Verbatim

IMAPStore me@linabee.uk
Host imap.fastmail.com
User me@linabee.uk
PassCmd "kwallet-query kdewallet --read-password fastmail"
TLSType IMAPS

Channel inbox
Far :me@linabee.uk:
Near :home:
Sync Full
Patterns INBOX
SyncState *

Channel composed
Far :me@linabee.uk:
Near :home:
Sync Push
Patterns Sent Drafts
SyncState *

Channel archive
Far :me@linabee.uk:
Near :home:
Sync Push
Patterns Archive
SyncState *

Group me@linabee.uk
Channels inbox composed archive
